---
title: Message Queue
id: message-queue
order: 4
description: "Control what happens when the user sends while a reply is still streaming: queue, drop, or interrupt."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - message queue
  - queue
  - whenBusy
  - interrupt
  - sendMessage
  - cancelQueued
---
